DeltaAI — Personal AI Crypto Trading Platform (Delta Exchange India)
A high-performance institutional trading platform engineered for Delta Exchange India, equipped with an automated strategy engine, real-time derivatives market center, server-side Gemini AI command intelligence, and comprehensive risk controls.
Core Architecture & Capabilities
Exchange Connectivity & Execution Modes
Delta Exchange India API Integration: Supports both Production India (api.india.delta.exchange) and Testnet (cdn.india.delta.exchange) gateways with an HMAC-SHA256 signature generator tester.
Paper Trading vs. Live Trading: Instant toggle between realistic simulated paper trading (tracking fills, margin, slippage, and floating P&L) and safety-gated Live Trading.
Currency View: 1-click toggle between USD ($) and INR (₹) across all balances, margins, and market prices.
Trading Dashboard & Visual Chart
Portfolio Metrics: Live Portfolio Value, Available Balance, Margin Used (% Capacity), Open Positions, Unrealised Floating P&L, Realised P&L, and Daily Performance (+%).
Equity Curve & Sharpe Visualizer: Dynamic equity growth trajectory chart with drawdown monitoring.
Interactive Candlestick Terminal: TradingView-style candlestick chart with timeframes (1m, 5m, 15m, 1h, 1D), volume bars, and overlay toggles for EMA 9, EMA 20, EMA 50, and VWAP, plus interactive crosshairs.
Live Market Centre
Real-time ticker feeds for BTCUSDT, ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT, XRPUSDT, DOGEUSDT, and AVAXUSDT.
Mark Price, Index Price, 24h High/Low, and Volume.
Derivatives Telemetry: Delta Exchange India 8-hour Funding Rates with live settlement countdown, aggregate Open Interest (in USD and contracts), and 24h liquidation statistics (Long vs. Short).
Strategy Engine (Futures Scalping, Trend & Options)
Three Automation Modes:
Manual Assist Mode: AI provides high-probability trade setups with 1-click staging into the execution pad.
Semi-Automatic Mode: Strategy trigger generates an approval card with Gemini AI validation; the trade is routed upon user confirmation.
Fully Automatic Mode: The engine detects signals (e.g., 1m/5m VWAP bounce, EMA 9/20 crossover), triggers server-side Gemini validation, and automatically routes orders with bracket Stop Loss (SL) and Take Profit (TP) targets.
Supported Strategies:
Futures Scalping: 1m/5m microstructure breakout using VWAP, EMA 9/20, and volume spikes.
Trend Following: 15m/1h momentum tracking with EMA 50/200 crossovers and MACD.
Options Multi-Leg: Long Call, Long Put, Bull Call Debit Spread, Bear Put Debit Spread, and Iron Condor with an interactive expiration payoff diagram calculating max profit, capped risk, and breakeven zones.
AI Institutional Command Centre
Market Sentiment Meter: Dynamic Bullish vs. Bearish sentiment meter with liquidity flow rationale.
Setup Confidence Score: Quantified setup conviction score (e.g., 87%).
AI Trade Card: Real-time trade recommendations specifying entry zones, stop losses, TP1, TP2, and risk/reward ratios, with 1-click execution pad staging.
Multi-Agent Trading Consensus: Collaborative analysis from four specialized AI agents (Trend Agent, Scalper Agent, Sentiment Agent, and Risk Officer).
Crypto Fear & Greed Gauge: Live market sentiment indicator.
Risk Management & Emergency Protection
Account Rules: Configurable limits for Max Daily Loss, Max Trades Per Day, Max Position Size (% of capital), and Max Leverage Cap with real-time compliance badges.
Emergency Kill Switch: 1-click fail-safe to immediately cancel all open orders and market-liquidate all active positions to cash.
Delta Neutral Auto-Hedge: Automatically calculates net delta on any asset and opens an offsetting hedge position.
PWA, Mobile Optimization & Audio Feedback
PWA Ready: Registered Service Worker, Web App Manifest, maskable and standard icons (192x192, 512x512, apple-touch-icon.png), and an in-app Install PWA button (with iOS Safari instructions).
Mobile Touch Screens: Responsive sub-navigation bar providing fast switching between Dashboard, Market Scanner, Positions, Strategy Centre, AI Centre, Risk Manager, and Settings.
Synthesized Web Audio: Clean audio signals for trade fills, take-profit executions, and risk warnings with a mute toggle.
Mobile Notifications: Integrated notification drawer with Telegram and WhatsApp alert testing.
