The excessive stop-loss protections have been implemented across the Auto-Pilot Sniper Engine:
Closed-Candle & Wick Protection
Wick Invalidation: Intra-candle price spikes or wick touches of Camarilla H4/L4 are blocked from triggering breakout entries.
5-Minute Candle Confirmation: Requires a confirmed 5-minute candle CLOSE above H4 (for Longs) or below L4 (for Shorts) before the signal status is promoted to PASS and Auto-Pilot order execution fires.
Visual Feedback: Added a real-time 5m Candle Close validation badge in the Execution Cockpit (5M BAR CLOSED (PASS) vs. ⏳ AWAITING 5M CLOSE).
ATR Volatility Stop Buffer
Preventing Whipsaw Exits: Rather than anchoring Stop Loss directly on the H3/L3 level where chop causes premature exits, an ATR14 volatility buffer is added:
Long Stop Loss: H3 - (0.5 * ATR14)
Short Stop Loss: L3 + (0.5 * ATR14)
When TP1 is achieved, the Net Zero Break-Even ratchet remains intact (entryPrice * (1 ± 0.0016)).
CPR Width Regime Filter
Central Pivot Range (CPR): Computed as Pivot = (High + Low + Close) / 3, BC = (High + Low) / 2, TC = (Pivot - BC) + Pivot, and CPR Width Ratio = |TC - BC| / Pivot.
Chop Risk Suppression: If CPR width is WIDE (> 0.35% of asset price), breakout auto-entries are suppressed with status:
"WIDE CPR - CHOP RISK - BREAKOUT SUPPRESSED".
Breakouts are only permitted during Average or Narrow CPR regimes (<= 0.35%).
Post-Stop Cooldown & 2-Strike Circuit Breaker
15-Minute Pair Cooldown: When any trade hits Stop Loss or Invalidation, a mandatory 15-minute cooldown timer locks Auto-Pilot entries on that specific pair, displaying a live countdown badge.
2-Strike Circuit Breaker: Tracks consecutive Stop Loss triggers. If 2 consecutive trades hit Stop Loss, the system automatically disarms Auto-Pilot (ARMED -> PAUSED), triggers a capital preservation warning, and logs:
"AUTO-PILOT HALTED: 2 Consecutive Stops Hit. Session Locked to Preserve Capital."
